{"id":175,"name":"Euphrate's NOT DONE","bottom":17201,"top":17999,"lifespan":30,"resetMode":2,"rooms":[{"vnum":17201,"name":"Start of a Huge Golden Ladder","desc":"You are starting a tremendous climb up a very tall ladder.  You look up ahead \nat the climb and you figure you will be climbing for a good hour before you \neven begin to reach the top.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"mountain","exits":[{"dir":4,"to":17202,"openCmd":17202}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-5,9]},{"vnum":17202,"name":"Climbing Up a Huge Golden Ladder","desc":"A gentle breeze blows through your hair as you continue climbing.  Its \nstrange but you seem to be climbing at a very quick rate, and you dont feel \nany fatigue at all.  This must be some type of magical ladder.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"mountain","exits":[{"dir":4,"to":17203,"openCmd":17203},{"dir":5,"to":17201,"openCmd":17201}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-4,9]},{"vnum":17203,"name":"Over Half Way Up a Huge Golden Ladder","desc":"What a view!  You have climbed what must have been miles of ladder in just a \nfew minutes!  You stop for a brief pause to check out the wonderfull view of \nall of Shadowdale.  The people just look like ants as you see them fighting \neach other.  Ooo there goes some type of flash, Elminster must have \nfireballed another newbie.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"mountain","exits":[{"dir":4,"to":17204,"openCmd":17204},{"dir":5,"to":17202,"openCmd":17202}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-3,9]},{"vnum":17204,"name":"At the Top of a Huge Golden Ladder","desc":"Finally you have reached the top of the ladder.  You are standing on a huge \nisland floating in the sky.  A deep forest lies in front of you to the \nNorth.  The only other safe direction is back down the ladder, all the other \ndirections are a quick way off of the island, a long plunge off of the edge.","flags":["no_mob","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17208,"openCmd":17208},{"dir":1,"to":17205,"openCmd":17205},{"dir":2,"to":17205,"openCmd":17205},{"dir":3,"to":17205,"openCmd":17205},{"dir":5,"to":17203,"openCmd":17203}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-2,9]},{"vnum":17205,"name":"Diving Off of the Island","desc":"In the grand style of Greg Luganis you take a dive off the side of the island, \nplunging yourself towards the ground at an alarming speed.  Don't you wish \nyou thought about it before jumping off the edge of the island now?","teleport":{"time":50,"target":17206,"flags":["look"]},"flags":["no_mob","indoors","no_summon"],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-186,-2,8]},{"vnum":17206,"name":"Plummeting Down Towards the Ground","desc":"Your life begins to flash before your eyes as you continue your journey \ntowards the land, if there was only some way to get out of this jam.  An idea \nis on the tip of your tongue, but you simply cant RECALL it.","teleport":{"time":50,"target":17207,"flags":["look"]},"flags":["no_mob","indoors","no_summon"],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-169,0,-9]},{"vnum":17207,"name":"Becoming One with the Ground","desc":"All good things must come to and end, and your journey down towards the \nground has just done so.  As you slam down hard into the ground your body \nbecomes as flat as a pancake, your brains oozing out like jelly from a donut.","flags":["death","no_mob","indoors","no_summon"],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-166,0,-9]},{"vnum":17208,"name":"Entranceway Into a Grand Forest","desc":"Huge trees tower before you, you have come across the entranceway into a \nmagnificent forest, your eyes can't penetrate very deep into the forest for \nis it so lush and thick.  You can hear the calls of many wild creatures \nechoing through the air.  A dirt path leads north into the forest through the \ntrees, you wonder where it could lead?  Exits in the east and west both are \noff the edge of the island.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17209,"openCmd":17209},{"dir":1,"to":17205,"openCmd":17205},{"dir":2,"to":17204,"openCmd":17204},{"dir":3,"to":17205,"openCmd":17205}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-2,8]},{"vnum":17209,"name":"Along the Path in a Huge Forest","desc":"You are walking along the path in a deep dark forest.  Every direction leads \nto more and more trees.  A dirt parth leads from the South to the North.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17210,"openCmd":17210},{"dir":2,"to":17208,"openCmd":17208}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,-2,7]},{"vnum":17210,"name":"Standing Before a Large Tree","desc":"Towering before you is a very large tree, it seems to reach upwards and touch \nthe sky.  This tree, beside from being tall, is also very thick.  A person \ncould practically live inside it if they wanted to.  The path continues from \nthe South to the North, and the tree blocks to exit to the West.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":17209},{"dir":3,"to":17211,"keywords":"Tree","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[{"keywords":"tree","desc":"The tree looks very big.  Upon closer inspection of the tree you notice a \nhandle set in it.  Could you possibly open it up?"}],"pos":[-187,-2,6]},{"vnum":17211,"name":"Inside a Large Tree","desc":"Aha a secret passage!  The inside of the tree is very spacious.  A set of \nstairs has been carved inside and they curve upwards, circling higher and \nhigher.","flags":["indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17210,"keywords":"Tree","flags":["door"],"openCmd":17210},{"dir":4,"to":17212,"openCmd":17212}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,-2,6]},{"vnum":17212,"name":"Entrance into the Faerie Village","desc":"Empty","flags":["no_mob","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17213,"openCmd":17213},{"dir":5,"to":17211,"openCmd":17211}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,-1,6]},{"vnum":17213,"name":"Street","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17216,"openCmd":17216},{"dir":1,"to":17214,"openCmd":17214},{"dir":2,"to":17212,"openCmd":17212},{"dir":3,"to":17215,"openCmd":17215}],"extra