its":[{"dir":0,"to":17264,"openCmd":17264}],"extras":[],"pos":[-192,-1,1]},{"vnum":17267,"name":"Street","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17268,"openCmd":17268},{"dir":1,"to":17264,"openCmd":17264},{"dir":2,"to":17269,"openCmd":17269}],"extras":[],"pos":[-193,-1,0]},{"vnum":17268,"name":"House","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":17267,"openCmd":17267}],"extras":[],"pos":[-193,-1,-1]},{"vnum":17269,"name":"House","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17267,"openCmd":17267}],"extras":[],"pos":[-193,-1,1]},{"vnum":17270,"name":"Entrance to the Faerie Palace","desc":"Straight ahead you see the highest point of all the trees.  There are many\nflowery vines and branches aranged to make a beautiful archway.  A very\nbright glow radiates from this part of the forest.  Thus making you believe\nthat someone very important resides here.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":17241,"openCmd":17241},{"dir":4,"to":17271,"openCmd":17271}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,-1,-6]},{"vnum":17271,"name":"Inside the Palace","desc":"You are bathed in golden lights that fill you with warmth and security.  You\nsee a few guards moving from room to room.  You notice that this is a far \nmore lovely place than the rest of the forest town you have already seen.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17272,"openCmd":17272},{"dir":5,"to":17270,"openCmd":17270}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,0,-6]},{"vnum":17272,"name":"Guard Post","desc":"You become wary when you see the many guards about.  You get the feeling you \nare close to something you aren't supposed to be at.  You are then approached\nby a guard asking you your business.  Do you honestly reply, or do you take \naction?!?","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17277,"openCmd":17277},{"dir":1,"to":17273,"openCmd":17273},{"dir":2,"to":17271,"openCmd":17271},{"dir":3,"to":17274,"openCmd":17274}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,0,-7]},{"vnum":17273,"name":"Altar of the Great Faerie Godess","desc":"There are so many beautiful flowers and plants surrounding the walls here.\nThis room is very quiet.  Many poems, letters, and prayers have been laid\nhere in a sacred-like manner.  You have never seen so many lovely varieties\nof greenery in your life.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17278,"openCmd":17278},{"dir":3,"to":17272,"openCmd":17272}],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,0,-7]},{"vnum":17274,"name":"Queen's Sitting Parlor","desc":"Many tables and chairs fill this room.  There are many distinguished people\nwaiting in here.  They are discussing many important topics, such as the\nQueen's business for the day, new economic programs for the citizens, the \nthreat of invaders to the throne.  So involved in their discussions are they\nthat they do not notice your appearance.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17275,"openCmd":17275},{"dir":1,"to":17272,"openCmd":17272}],"extras":[],"pos":[-189,0,-7]},{"vnum":17275,"name":"The Queen's Grand Dinning Room","desc":"This room is nearly empty.  A very long huge dinning table rests in the \ncenter of this room.  Elegant settings are neatly laid out by the large\nkitchen staff.  Delicate tapestries hang on the walls where they may have\nbeen hanging for hundreds of years.  A large emblem of the royal crest is \nprinted on the Queen's chair.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17283,"openCmd":17283},{"dir":1,"to":17277,"openCmd":17277},{"dir":2,"to":17274,"openCmd":17274},{"dir":3,"to":17276,"openCmd":17276}],"extras":[],"pos":[-189,0,-8]},{"vnum":17276,"name":"Kitchen","desc":"This room is very busy with activity.  Lots of servants preparing the next\nmeal of the day.  This room is filled with mouth-watering aromas, many \nbubbling pots and pans, and delicious desserts are resting off to the side.\nMost of the dishes look almost to good to eat!  Awww...go ahead, take a \nlittle taste.","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17275,"openCmd":17275}],"extras":[],"pos":[-190,0,-8]},{"vnum":17277,"name":"The Queen's Throne Room","desc":"This is the brightest room of all.  The Grand Queen herself is majestically\nminding her throne.  She is surrounded by many aides and guards.  Stunning \nscraps of color wave in the light breezes filtering through the room.  A soft\nbuzz of conversation is all that you hear.  Oh no!  Your presence has been\ndetected!","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":17281,"openCmd":17281},{"dir":1,"to":17278,"openCmd":17278},{"dir":2,"to":17272,"openCmd":17272},{"dir":3,"to":17275,"openCmd":17275}],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,0,-8]},{"vnum":17278,"name":"Queen's Bedroom","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-187,0,-8]},{"vnum":17279,"name":"17279","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-163,0,-9]},{"vnum":17280,"name":"17280","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-160,0,-9]},{"vnum":17281,"name":"17281","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-188,0,-9]},{"vnum":17282,"name":"17282","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-157,0,-9]},{"vnum":17283,"name":"17283","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-189,0,-9]},{"vnum":17284,"name":"17284","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-154,0,-9]},{"vnum":17285,"name":"A Dark Passageway","desc":"As you head off into this direction you notice the area getting darker and \ndarker, the branches here arent as well kept up as the rest of the village \nand the leaves are starting to block out the light.  It doesnt seem as if \nmany people ever go in this direction.","flags":["no_mob","indoors"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17286,"openCmd":17286},{"dir":3,"to":17253,"openCmd":17253}],"extras":[],"pos":[-182,-1,0]},{"vnum":17286,"name":"Tight Squeeze","desc":"The branches get tighter and tighter together here, you have to practically \ncrawl through the small opening that the leaves and branches are making.  A \nstrange howling can be heard in the distance as a chill wind start to blow \nacross your body.  This place is getting spooky!","mobLimit":1,"flags":["indoors","tunnel"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17287,"openCmd":17287},{"dir":3,"to":17285,"openCmd":17285}],"extras":[],"pos":[-181,-1,0]},{"vnum":17287,"name":"Along a Dark Passageway","desc":"The passage is a little bigger here, you have more room to move around.  The \nscenery hasnt changed at all though.  You can no longer hear the forest \nanimals like you could in the village.  Deep down you know you are entering a \nbad place.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17288,"openCmd":17288},{"dir":3,"to":17286,"openCmd":17286}],"extras":[],"pos":[-180,-1,0]},{"vnum":17288,"name":"Entrance to a Shadowy Grove","desc":"The passageway begins to open up, but the sky and ground are totally blocked \nout now, no light is able to get in.  You have entered a shadowy grove among \nthe trees.  You can almost feel the forces of evil at work here.  Two large \nguards are guarding the entranceway further into the grove.  It doesnt look \nlike they are too happy to see you.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":17289,"openCmd":17289},{"dir":3,"to":17287,"openCmd":17287}],"extras":[],"pos":[-179,-1,0]},{"vnum":17289,"name":"A Shadowy Grove","desc":"The branches and leaves form a huge chamber here, blocking out all light and \nsound.  The are various shelves along the walls where skulls of various \nfaerie's and other forest animals lie.  A large faerie woman sits in the \nmiddle of the room here, she is starting into a caulron of bubbling water.  \nShe looks up at you as you enter.  An evil grin forms on her face and you see \nher yellow teeth.  She seems very pleased to see you here, your skulls can be \nadded to her collection.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":3,"to":17288,"openCmd":17288}],"extras":[],"pos":[-178,-1,0]},{"vnum":17290,"name":"17290","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-151,0,-9]},{"vnum":17291,"name":"17291","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-148,0,-9]},{"vnum":17292,"name":"17292","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-145,0,-9]},{"vnum":17293,"name":"17293","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-142,0,-9]},{"vnum":17294,"name":"17294","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-139,0,-9]},{"vnum":17295,"name":"17295","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-136,0,-9]},{"vnum":17296,"name":"17296","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-133,0,-9]},{"vnum":17297,"name":"17297","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-130,0,-9]},{"vnum":17298,"name":"17298","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-127,0,-9]},{"vnum":17299,"name":"17299","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-124,0,-9]},{"vnum":17300,"name":"17300","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-121,0,-9]},{"vnum":17301,"name":"17301","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-118,0,-9]},{"vnum":17302,"name":"17302","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-115,0,-9]},{"vnum":17303,"name":"17303","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-112,0,-9]},{"vnum":17304,"name":"17304","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-109,0,-9]},{"vnum":17305,"name":"17305","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-106,0,-9]},{"vnum":17306,"name"