rates are\ncreating a new world.","flags":["large","no_death"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":14999,"openCmd":14999,"toZone":140},{"dir":2,"to":17999,"openCmd":17999}],"extras":[],"pos":[-172,0,-9]},{"vnum":17999,"name":"Euphrates Chamber","desc":"You are in a comfortable chamber.  A fireplace glows brightly on the south \nwall, lighting up the entire room.  Above the fireplace is a grand painting \nof the god Euphrates, he is in battle with the forces of good, using his \nmagic to destroy all.  In the corner near the fire a huge multi-chromatic \ndragon with many heads is sleeping.  Across from the fireplace is a huge \nthrone made of pure diamonds, it sparkles in the firelight.  The floor is \ncovered with a red lush carpet and the walls with many tapestries.  Euphrates \nseems to enjoy a higher class of living.","flags":["indoors","no_death"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":1800,"keywords":"Ace","flags":["door"],"openCmd":374,"toZone":22}],"extras":[],"pos":[-172,0,-8]}],"mobs":[],"mobProtos":{},"objProtos":{}}